'''Legendary Weapons''' are a rarity of weapons that are one tier above [[Rare Weapons|rare weapons]] and one tier below [[Godly Weapons|godly weapons]]. These types of weapons have a 5% chance of being unboxed from [[boxes]], require twelve rare [[shards]] to [[Crafting|craft]] in the crafting station, can be obtained through [[:Category:Events|events]], and can be [[Trading|traded]] among players at any time. Legendary weapons generally use more popular colors such as black, bright red, blue, green, and purple as intended by [[Nikilis]]<ref>Nikilis. (2019, March 19). ''[$3000+ USD] [hiring] graphic designers: Weapon skins''. DevForum. Retrieved October 26, 2021, from https://devforum.roblox.com/t/3000-usd-hiring-graphic-designers-weapon-skins/254136.</ref>. There are currently 57 different legendary weapons in the game, ''39'' being [[:Category:Knives|knives]] and ''18'' being [[:Category:Guns|guns]]. 

